<title>USA: Commonwealth Bancorp names new president.</title>
<headline>Commonwealth Bancorp names new president.</headline>
<dateline>VALLEY FORGE, Pa. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commonwealth Bancorp said on Monday it named Patrick Ward to the newly-created position of president and chief operating officer of the company and its Commonwealth Bank subsidiary.</p>
<p>Ward, 40, has been senior vice president and chief financial officer since joining the company in 1992. He would be replaced in those positions by Charles Johnston, the company said.</p>
<p>Johnston, 41, was previously CFO and treasurer for TFC Enterprises Inc, a finance company located in Norfolk, Virginia, Commonwealth said.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610,</p>
</text>
